<p>Hello {{ username }},</p>
{% if purpose == 'invitation' %}
    <p>An account was created for you on {{ app_name }}. Choose your password to start using it:</p>
{% else %}
    <p>Someone (probably you, or an administrator) asked for a new password for your account on {{ app_name }}. Choose it here:</p>
{% endif %}
<p><a href="{{ url }}">{{ url }}</a></p>
<p>The link works once, until {{ expires_at|date('Y-m-d H:i T') }}. Your username is <strong>{{ username }}</strong>.</p>
{% if purpose != 'invitation' %}
    <p>You did not ask for it? Ignore this e-mail: your current password keeps working.</p>
{% endif %}
